Polish Football Manager Engine
==============================

This product includes software developed by Artemov Ivan (ZOXEXIVO) and the
Open Football contributors (https://github.com/ZOXEXIVO/open-football),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This is a modified fork of Open Football. Modifications are documented in
FORK_CHANGES.md and marked with "Modified from upstream" notices in the
affected source files, as required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0.

The upstream embedded world database (src/database/src/data/database.db) has
been removed from this fork. This fork loads an externally supplied world
database generated from independent data sources.
